          "type": "tab",
          "settings": {
            "label": "Description",
            "content": "<p>Experience deeper sleep, less pain, and calmer mornings, all from the comfort of your bed. Terra Therapy’s grounding sheets are woven with 400 thread count organic cotton and 10% pure silver fiber to deliver a safe, comfortable, and effective grounding connection every night.  Plug into any grounded outlet and let Earth’s natural electrons flow through the sheet to support your body’s recovery, from better sleep and reduced inflammation to calmer nervous system function.  No EMFs. No batteries. Just effortless, science-backed healing while you sleep.</p>"
          }
        },
        "tab_NPiVA6": {
          "type": "tab",
          "settings": {
            "label": "Who is it for?",
            "content": "<p>Grounding can support you if you’re:<br/></p><ul><li>Struggling with poor sleep, racing thoughts, or insomnia</li><li>Waking up stiff, sore, or fatigued</li><li>Living with chronic pain, inflammation, or autoimmune issues</li><li>Experiencing anxiety, stress, or hormonal imbalance</li><li>Looking for a natural, non-invasive wellness solution</li></ul>"
