            "content": "<ul><li>Free U.S. shipping on orders over $100</li><li>Fast delivery: 2–6 days (U.S. & Canada), 7–10 days (EU & international)</li><li>90-Day Money-Back Guarantee: Try it risk-free. If you don’t feel the benefits, send it back. No questions asked.</li><li>Returns: Contact our support team for easy return instructions. Products must be in good condition.</li><li>Support: Our team is available 24/7 to help with ordering, setup, or troubleshooting.</li></ul>"
