        "tab_xzqVK9": {
          "type": "tab",
          "settings": {
            "label": "Care Instructions",
            "content": "<p>To maintain conductivity and extend the life of your grounding sheet:<br/></p><ul><li>Wash on gentle cycle with mild detergent</li><li>Avoid bleach, fabric softeners, or dryer sheets</li><li>Air dry when possible, or tumble dry on low</li><li>Do not dry clean</li><li>Wash regularly to remove body oils that can affect performance</li></ul><p>We include full care instructions in the box, and our customer team is always available if you need help.</p>"
